Read PROJECT_BRIEF.md at the repo root before doing anything — it is the source
of truth for architecture, collection names, and field names. Reuse those exact
names everywhere; do not invent parallel schemas.

Non-negotiable rules:
- All money is integer paise, never floating-point rupees, in every layer except
  the final React display component.
- Razorpay Capital and Razorpay Payroll have no public sandbox — any code that
  touches them must be clearly commented as SYNTHETIC and must live behind the
  same interface a real integration would use, so swapping it later is a
  one-file change.
- The AI service only writes "pending" recommendations. It never calls a
  Razorpay payout endpoint. Only the Express server executes approved actions.
- Don't add new npm/pip packages beyond what a phase's prompt asks for without
  flagging it first.